.Sh HISTORY
The default encryption cipher was changed from 3DES to AES-256 in
OpenSSL 3.5.
.Pp
The
.Sy -section
option was added in OpenSSL 3.0.0.
.Pp
The
.Sy -multivalue-rdn
option has become obsolete in OpenSSL 3.0.0 and has no effect.
.Pp
The
.Sy -engine
option was deprecated in OpenSSL 3.0. The <-nodes> option was deprecated
in OpenSSL 3.0, too; use
.Sy -noenc
instead.
.Pp
The
.Sy -reqexts
option has been made an alias of
.Sy -extensions
in OpenSSL 3.2.
.Pp
Since OpenSSL 3.2, generated certificates bear X.509 version 3 unless
.Sy -x509v1
is given, and key identifier extensions are included by default.
.Pp
Since OpenSSL 3.3, the
.Sy -verify
option will exit with 1 on failure.
